    character2: {fileID: 5513359351382692184, guid: 4c74d9b45011c0a4cb33179b186c1f73, type: 3}
    name: Liezel
    soundToPlay: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1cfd43b09479e4b35a0341f36b492e9b, type: 3}
    audioPitchOffset: 0
    font: {fileID: 0}
    textSpeed: 0.022
    textPunctSpeed: 0.18
    lettersUntilSFX: 3
    sentences:
    - Well, I never said I was particularly bad at it.
    - <SFX_liezel_wondering>I will, however, admit I had help. It was not originally
      my intention to make a book that crossed time and space.
    - "I only wanted to divine the truth behind the \u201Cmagic attacks\u201D. Instead...
      Or perhaps because of that, I saw your future."
    - Whether it was an engkanto trying to help me or just the natural outcome of
      my divination, I cannot say.
    - "Either way, I could not have done any of this if not for my sister\u2019s
      notes."
