    - target: {fileID: 4746459191129394785, guid: e03ab5007ef7b460e9e1351d398246ac, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[0]'
      value: "<i>(Hey, isn\u2019t this the Rommel guy? Hm. Who is he with?) </i>"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4746459191129394785, guid: e03ab5007ef7b460e9e1351d398246ac, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[1]'
      value: <i>(Anyway, this looks like an antique though... Weird. Why is it just
        lying around in town?) </i>
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4746459191129394785, guid: e03ab5007ef7b460e9e1351d398246ac, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[2]'
      value: <i>(Maybe the tour guide knows something about this?) </i>
