    - target: {fileID: 5654484641697981369, guid: 0d0aec03b4a2e4eebac4d306d494957c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[0]'
      value: <SFX_liezel_questioning><i>(Oh, a chess board. Looks like the game got
        cut off before it could finish.)</i>
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5654484641697981369, guid: 0d0aec03b4a2e4eebac4d306d494957c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[1]'
      value: <SFX_liezel_concerned><i>(Only the kings and pawn-... Is that real gold?
        Awfully wasteful to buy a golden chess piece.)</i>
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5654484641697981369, guid: 0d0aec03b4a2e4eebac4d306d494957c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[2]'
      value: <i>(Whoever was playing this golden king will be cornered by pawns and
        the other king, if it keeps going left.)</i>
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5654484641697981369, guid: 0d0aec03b4a2e4eebac4d306d494957c, type: 3}
